        "cooked": "<p>FIRST!!11!One!<br>\n<br>\nSeriously though, I am quite excited to get my hands on this game, especially after the little preview that Sea-Envy first posted in the other (SOTM:VG) forum. Thanks Sea-Envy :)<br>\n<br>\nWatch Splattercat play with some fun commentary here:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=xGIWU7YSJy8\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=xGIWU7YSJy8&nbsp;</a><br>\nHe seems unfamiliar with the SOTM Universe. Maybe that will change in the future....<br>\n~A-Kat</p>",
