        "raw": "<p>FIRST!!11!One!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nSeriously though, I am quite excited to get my hands on this game, especially after the little preview that Sea-Envy first posted in the other (SOTM:VG) forum. Thanks Sea-Envy :)<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWatch Splattercat play with some fun commentary here:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=xGIWU7YSJy8 \" rel=\"nofollow\" style=\"color: rgb(40, 131, 222); font-family: &amp;quot;open sans&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;helveticaneue&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;helvetica neue&amp;quot;,helvetica,arial,sans-serif; font-size: 14.4px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: underline; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=xGIWU7YSJy8&nbsp;</a><br />\r\nHe seems unfamiliar with the SOTM Universe. Maybe that will change in the future....<br />\r\n~A-Kat</p>",
